/*!
 * Meridian Atlas — History / Borders view.
 *
 * An original atlas identity and layout. The Canton of Zürich design system
 * informs the typographic scale, spacing rhythm, restrained surfaces and
 * focus treatment (see docs/design-system.md); no cantonal heraldry, shield,
